  id: tablet_waking
  displayName: 'Tablet: The Waking'
  order: 11
  text: 'The whole Engine, and around it ants without number. "It wakes when the colony is strong enough to feed it: relics for its memory, obsidian for its skin, food for the hands that turn it."'
  item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 165364454b27d3c42b33231485108050, type: 2}
  count: 3
